  "depth": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - along the side view at 3.436 px/mm: the cover over the first 17.5 mm, the finger walls on to 138.0, the base rails behind them to 162.7, and the mounting plate at the rear, 74.33 high, from about 165.5 to the 168.5; the plate is taken as 3 thick. Between the rails the channel runs back to the plate. The top and bottom views draw the rails and plate as one 30.5 mm band, as the top view shows them."
